<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Tuesday updated figures of livestock exports to Mexico from the state of Texas to Aug 4.</p>
<p>Species		   Wk-To-Date   Yr-Date   Last Year</p>
<p>1) Beef Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		 34	    69,553     62,515</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   2	     1,453	  881</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	11	     2,701	1,351</p>
<p>2) Hogs</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		  0	     1,063     31,831</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   8		 499	  314</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females     336	     6,375	1,613</p>
<p>3) Dairy Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Breeding Males	   0		 167	   37</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Females	37	    17,285	7,809</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
